# NOTE: contracts/generated/ is intentionally NOT ignored. Per ADR-0002,
# generated Python/Java bindings are checked into git for reviewability and
# built from, not produced fresh by CI or a consuming build. Never hand-edit
# it -- regenerate via `make gen` (tools/codegen/generate.py) and commit the
# diff; the contracts-drift CI job fails if it disagrees with a fresh
# regeneration.
docker-compose.override.yml
